On **.NET 10 SDK**, you **no longer need `TestingPlatformDotnetTestSupport`**. Instead, add a `"test"` section to `global.json`:

```json
{
  "sdk": { "version": "10.0.100" },
  "test": { "runner": "Microsoft.Testing.Platform" }
}
```

This tells `dotnet test` to use MTP natively — arguments are passed directly (no `--` separator needed).

